# RIMSHIRE: a foe knocked into your own disk is hurt again; yours is not.
game rimshire
cheat war 1
cheat cpu 1 -1
cheat army 0 SS
cheat army 1 S
cheat battle 6 1 0
cheat field 0
cheat place 0 100 128
cheat place 1 200 128
cheat place 2 160 128
waituntil bphase == 1 200
press A
hold RIGHT 40
hold A 40
wait 1
waituntil moving == 0 600
expect d2_hp == 2
expect d1_hp == 4
expect d0_hp == 4
